invariant: INV-61
file: handshake_auth.c
catches: cnsa2_test_mldsa
reason: the ML-DSA-87 signed content loses the NUL byte after the context
  string, so it is no longer RFC 9846 section 4.4.3's content. The mock
  signs the content with the NUL, every pinned handshake fails, and
  test_mldsa_signed_content's SHA-256 of the bytes no longer matches
  hsa_hash_signed_content's digest.

--- old
    wb_bytes(&w, (const uint8_t *)ctx, sizeof ctx); // sizeof keeps the NUL
--- new
    wb_bytes(&w, (const uint8_t *)ctx, sizeof ctx - 1);
